[statement]
A package installed for its `install_if` follows the package completing its
condition even inside another's walk: `d-extra` follows `d`, before `a`'s
next dependency `e`.

[repository]
P:a
V:1
D:d e

P:d
V:1

P:e
V:1

P:d-extra
V:1
i:d

[request]
a

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install d 1
install d-extra 1
install e 1
install a 1
